    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/logicSummary> "Definition includes offences against various Acts and sections";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/premiseText> "The definition of a protective service offence includes offences against section 24AB, 29, 46 (other than paragraph b), 47, 47A, 79, 89 or 89A of the Crimes Act 1914.";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/conclusionText> "The definition of a protective service offence is a subset of the Crimes Act 1914";
