    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/operator> "implies";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/logicSummary> "Definition implies certain conditions for an offence to be considered a protective service offence";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/premiseText> "The definition of a protective service offence includes offences against Division 72 of the Criminal Code that relates to a person, place or thing in respect of which the Australian Federal Police is performing protective service functions.";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/conclusionText> "If an offence falls under Division 72 of the Criminal Code, it implies that the Australian Federal Police is performing protective service functions";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/executionSurface> "modalities::argumentation";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/confidence> 1.0000;
