    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/operator> "and";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/logicSummary> "Definition includes multiple conditions for an offence to be considered a protective service offence";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/premiseText> "The definition of a protective service offence includes offences against section 6 of the Crimes Act 1914, or section 11.1 or 11.4 of the Criminal Code that relates to an offence mentioned in paragraph (a)";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/conclusionText> "The definition of a protective service offence is and includes multiple conditions";
