    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/asserts> <https://ns.webcivics.net/concept/australian-federal-police-and-other-legislation-amendment-act-2004-sch-3-sec-42-ss-1-norm>.
<https://ns.webcivics.net/concept/australian-federal-police-and-other-legislation-amendment-act-2004-sch-3-sec-42-ss-1-norm> a <https://ns.webcivics.net/values/Obligation>;
